    {
      "chunkIndex": 4,
      "contentPreview": "MapMcp(\u0022/mcp\u0022) from ModelContextProtocol.AspNetCore 1.0.0 expands into FIVE endpoints, not one: POST/GET/DELETE /mcp/ (streamable HTTP) plus GET /mcp/sse and POST /mcp/message (legacy SSE). Conventions chained onto the MapMcp builder apply to all five. Any test that counts endpoints under /mcp must expect 5.",
